// Title: Nile absolute value operator definition (piecewise)
// Author: not credited on the listing page
// Source: VPRI TR-2011-004 (STEPS 2011 progress report), Section 'Graphics' / Nile syntax; listing after 'Definition of the absolute value operator, which makes use of the conditional expression syntax modeled after piecewise function notation'; PDF page 11 (printed page 10).
// Transcribed from the page images; text-layer differences noted below.
| (a:Real) | : Real
  { -a, if a < 0
     a, otherwise }

// Transcription notes
// - The text layer and the page image agree on all three lines.
// - Indentation as printed; exact space counts may differ slightly.
